      "role": "user",
      "content": "It feels like the shadows in this house are getting heavier every night, Julian. I look at the dust settling on everything and I just... I feel so tired. Not the kind of tired sleep can fix. It's like my very soul is just worn thin, and I don't see the point in fighting the decay anymore. Everything is just so much effort.",
